> **Archived — October 16, 2026**
>
> This historical dynamic DNS implementation relies on legacy GoDaddy web-login endpoints and is no longer maintained. It should not be used as a current DNS-update integration.
>
> Source and history remain available for reference; no further updates or support are planned.

